(  ```) Tj
T*
(  ) Tj
T*
(  ## 5. Generative-AI use) Tj
T*
(  ) Tj
T*
(  I used OpenAI Codex during this assignment to diagnose problems in the environment and code. It also) Tj
T*
(      ) Tj
(identified that an active VS Code Jupyter kernel was blocking the evidence script from deleting and) Tj
T*
(      ) Tj
(rebuilding `.venv`. I ran the project locally to check the workflow and am responsible for) Tj
T*
(      ) Tj
(understanding the final code and results.) Tj
T*
T*
